FuncDef:
The display bgp mdt routing-table command displays BGP Multicast Distribution Tree (MDT) routes.
ParaDef:
{'Parameters': 'route-distinguisher route-distinguisher', 'Info': 'Displays BGP routing information of the specified Route Distinguisher (RD).\nThe RD formats are divided into the following types:\n2-byte AS number:4-byte user-defined number, for example, 101:3. An AS number ranges from 0 to 65535. A user-defined number ranges from 0 to 4294967295. The AS number and the user-defined number cannot be 0s at the same time. That is, an RD cannot be 0:0.Integral 4-byte AS number:2-byte user-defined number, for example, 65537:3. An AS number ranges from 65536 to 4294967295. A user-defined number ranges from 0 to 65535. The AS number and user-defined number cannot be both 0s. That is, an RD cannot be 0:0.4-byte AS number in dotted notation:2-byte user-defined number, for example, 0.0:3 or 0.1:0.4-byte AS number in dotted notation is in the format of x.y, wherex and y are integers that range from 0 to 65535 and from 0 to 65535, respectively. A user-defined number ranges from 0 to 65535. The AS number and user-defined number cannot be both 0s. That is, an RD cannot be 0.0:0.IPv4-address:2-byte user-defined number, for example, 192.168.122.15:1. An IP address ranges from 0.0.0.0 to 255.255.255.255. A user-defined number ranges from 0 to 65535.'}
{'Parameters': 'all', 'Info': 'Displays all the BGP routes of MDT.\n-'}
{'Parameters': 'vpn-instance vpn-instance-name', 'Info': 'Displays the BGP routing information of the specified VPN instance.\nThe value is a string of 1 to 31 case-sensitive characters, spaces not supported. In addition, the VPN instance name must not be _public_. When double quotation marks are used around the string, spaces are allowed in the string.'}
{'Parameters': 'network', 'Info': 'Specifies an IPv4 network address.\nThe value is in dotted decimal notation.'}
{'Parameters': 'mask-length', 'Info': 'Specifies the mask length of an IPv4 address.\nThe value is an integer ranging from 0 to 32.'}
{'Parameters': 'mask', 'Info': 'Specifies the mask of an IPv4 address.\nThe value is in dotted decimal notation.'}
{'Parameters': 'longer-prefixes', 'Info': 'Matches according to the mask longer than the specified length.\n-'}
{'Parameters': 'community-filter basic-community-filter-number', 'Info': 'Specifies the number of a basic community filter.\nThe value is an integer ranging from 1 to 99.'}
{'Parameters': 'community-filter community-filter-name', 'Info': 'Specifies the name of the community filter.\nThe value is a string of 1 to 51 case-sensitive characters. The string cannot be all digits.'}
{'Parameters': 'community-filter advanced-community-filter-number', 'Info': 'Specifies the number of an advanced community filter.\nThe value is an integer ranging from 100 to 199.'}
{'Parameters': 'whole-match', 'Info': 'Indicates exact matching.\n-'}
{'Parameters': 'community community-number', 'Info': 'Specify community number.\nThe value is an integer ranging from 0 to 4294967295.'}
{'Parameters': 'community aa:nn', 'Info': 'Specify aa<0-65535>:nn <0-65535>.\nThe value is a string of 1 to 11 case-sensitive characters, spaces not supported.'}
{'Parameters': 'internet', 'Info': 'Displays the BGP public network routes carrying the internet community attribute.\n-'}
{'Parameters': 'no-advertise', 'Info': 'Displays the BGP public network routes carrying the No-Advertise community attribute.\n-'}
{'Parameters': 'no-export', 'Info': 'Displays the BGP public network routes carrying the No-Export community attribute.\n-'}
{'Parameters': 'no-export-subconfed', 'Info': 'Displays the BGP public network routes carrying the No-Export-Subconfed community attribute.\n-'}
{'Parameters': 'large-community aa:bb:cc', 'Info': 'Specifies a value of the Large-Community attribute.\nThe value is a string of 5 to 32 case-sensitive characters, spaces not supported. In addition, the VPN instance name must not be _public_. When double quotation marks are used around the string, spaces are allowed in the string.'}
{'Parameters': 'large-community-filter large-community-filter-name', 'Info': 'Specifies the name of a Large-Community filter.\nThe value is a string of 1 to 51 case-sensitive characters, spaces not supported.'}
